\*\*EVM-specific\*\*: \`'eth:connected'\` \`'eth:createWallet'\` \`'eth:recoverWallet'\` \`'eth:switchNetworks'\` \`'eth:send'\` \`'eth:receive'\` \`'eth:buy'\` \`'eth:connectors'\`

